<title>POLAND: SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN POLISH FIRST DIVISION.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN POLISH FIRST DIVISION.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in the Polish</p>
<p>first division after the weekend's matches:</p>
<p>8 - Bogdan Prusek (Sokol Tychy)</p>
<p>7 - Slawomir Wojciechowski (GKS Katowice)</p>
<p>5 - Marcin Mieciel (Legia Warszawa), Piotr Reiss (Lech Poznan)</p>
<p>4 - Jacek Dembinski (Widzew Lodz), Daniel Dubicki (LKS Lodz),</p>
<p>Krzysztof Piskula (Lech Poznan), Janusz Swierad (Wisla Krakow),</p>
<p>Emmanuel Tetteh (Polonia Warszawa), Ryszard Wieczorek (Odra</p>
<p>Wodzislaw), Krzysztof Zagorski (Odra Wodzislaw)</p>
